{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026v11v4aK52S1795777083.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國網球巡迴賽香港公開賽，港將石卓盈女單八強止步。</p><p></p><p>黑衫的石卓盈面對中國球手王雨涵，首盤頭七局，各造出一次破發，</p><p></p><p>石卓盈第八局再次失守，先輸3-6。王雨涵曾在溫網及澳網青年組，首輪取勝，21歲的石卓盈就在去年全港公開賽稱后，這位港將第二盤贏回6-2，追平盤數。</p><p></p><p>決勝盤打「搶十」，石卓盈落後4-9之下，追剩2分，但最終都輸7-10，無緣四強。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:43:51.762662+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T18:37:34.283061+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:15.157075+00:00","content_hash":"ec5f89d6e662ac390e633702eb508fd9ac31f48a26ed2d1e524d23208a10c246","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:43:51.762662+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}